{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:29 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:29 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:29 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img alt=\"蔡明紹爆「幸運糖」  近年半再次起孖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/6171a278bd79b500c7143f70a207eae7/2026-11/r5_3.jpg\"/><p>第五場賽事又爆大冷，蔡明紹胯下的巫廄「幸運糖」以30倍的冷門身位，憑頸位之差殺退了配奧爾民的蔡廄35倍冷門「環保巨星」，令是場連贏位派彩高達$6,154.00。</p><p>蔡明紹今日已於頭場策蔡約翰麾下的「精算無雙」爆出34倍獨贏，個人梅開二度，也是繼2025年6月25日後，重嚐起孖滋味。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/010c4ef57180efbf6a48e65e3e4337e7/2026-11/r55.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e71ad25de8a22ba08d4d4e366fbc1ac9/2026-11/r56.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cc80a7e50d3c3b62faea65e51e590827/2026-11/r57.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5e0be0639110d46a5d8fe9aea3cf1e36/2026-11/r58.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/01f7f5b67e84ef0539514eeb3cbb0d14/2026-11/r59.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:54:05.286996+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:29:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:20:38.828486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T08:47:30.175977+00:00","content_hash":"bf8ff0186f1721139f757386447b51500ce4cc65cf938800af3d33c2a4478afd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}